NOTICE:

This repository contains only PUBLIC components of the Slovak Steed project.

Certain core technologies are NOT included in this repository and remain
confidential and proprietary, including but not limited to:

- reward_function.py and all control logic
- reinforcement learning training pipelines
- domain randomization parameters
- rider-weight steering control system (IP-OPP-001)
- adaptive locomotion algorithms (IP-OPP-002)
- trained model weights and datasets
- internal knowledge base (master_kb.json)
- IP strategy documents

These components are protected as:
- trade secrets
- patent-pending technologies

Unauthorized use, reproduction, or reverse engineering of these
protected components is strictly prohibited.

------------------------------------------------------------------

OPEN-SOURCE USAGE POLICY:

This repository follows a strict clean-room development policy:

- External open-source projects are used for reference only
- Core algorithms are independently developed from scientific sources
- No direct copying of control logic or training systems is allowed

This ensures:
- intellectual independence
- patentability of the system
- legal compliance with third-party licenses

